# QA replay of the extract list's roll call, YOUR EXTRACTS THIS RAID (owner, 2026-10-15, from a panel of four: A, "Roll
# call, then fly-out"). A developer build plays it with --dev-view --dev-script; how to run it, and what each still must
# show: extract-roll-call.md beside this file. Times are in seconds.
#
# A snapshot step takes about 0.15 to 1.4 s (the window, the map and the cue, longer at a larger window and on a busy
# PC; the developer view's tabs are taken after it, while the script goes on) and the step after it follows 0.3 s later,
# so one roll call can't give a still at each of its moments: two raids on Customs read the same list, the first for
# its start and the band gone (t0, t1), the second for its icons in the air, its landings and its end (t2, t3, t4). The
# second also shows that a new raid calls its list out afresh. The waits keep to the pace of 2026-10-16 (owner: "too
# fast"): the four icons lift off 0.4 s apart from 1.6 s and fly 1.5 s, the last lands at 4.3 s, and the cue is gone by
# 6.4 s.

# A --dev-view session starts on settings of its own, as at a first start, so the tour opened by itself at chapter 1
# once the data was there. It ends first.
tour end
# A PMC raid on Customs: its artwork read first, then the loading, its steps and the start. The RAID LOADING cue goes
# before the list is read.
map customs
wait 3
load
steps
start
wait 3
# The position, at a PMC spawn west of the middle, between Crossroads and ZB-1013; its first-fix notice goes in 6 s.
pos -220.21 1.07 -141.94 90
wait 6.5

# The game's extract list, as a screenshot taken now shows it: three extracts lit and ZB-1013 marked ??:??:??. Customs'
# other PMC extracts are struck out at once.
exits Crossroads "Trailer Park" "ZB-1013?" "Railroad Passage (Flare)"
wait 0.3
snapshot %TEMP%\shturmap-qa\extract-roll-call\t0
# The band gone with its rows (3.1 s), all four landed (the last at 4.3 s), the title on its halo (to 5.8 s): about 4.0
# to 5.0 s, as the snapshot step before it takes 0.15 to 1.3 s (QA, 2026-10-16: after a wait of 1.5 s it came at 3.6 s
# at 900x560, Railroad Passage still unlit and ZB-1013 in flight; release QA of 0.7.0, 2026-10-26: with the developer
# view's tabs in the step it came at 6.0 s at the default window, the cue gone).
wait 2.8
snapshot %TEMP%\shturmap-qa\extract-roll-call\t1

# The raid ends (RAID OVER, its replay), and the next one on Customs reads the same list.
wait 4
end
wait 3
load
steps
start
wait 6
pos -220.21 1.07 -141.94 90
wait 1
exits Crossroads "Trailer Park" "ZB-1013?" "Railroad Passage (Flare)"
# Three icons in the air, the fourth still on its row (it lifts off at 2.8 s).
wait 2.2
snapshot %TEMP%\shturmap-qa\extract-roll-call\t2
# All four landed (the last at 4.3 s) and ringing, the title on its halo: about 3.9 to 5.0 s.
wait 0.9
snapshot %TEMP%\shturmap-qa\extract-roll-call\t3
# The end: the cue gone (6.4 s), the rings over: about 6.9 to 8.5 s.
wait 2.5
snapshot %TEMP%\shturmap-qa\extract-roll-call\t4
exit
